<p data-path-to-node="7">De Tanger &agrave; Agadir, la mise &agrave; niveau des stades (Ibn Battouta, Moulay Abdellah, Adrar) d&eacute;passe le cadre du football. Il s\'agit de cr&eacute;er des p&ocirc;les de vie, de culture et de loisirs connect&eacute;s. Ces projets exigent une rigueur technique et une rapidit&eacute; d\'ex&eacute;cution o&ugrave; l\'expertise certifi&eacute;e devient la cl&eacute; du succ&egrave;s.</p>";s:10:"content_en";s:477:"<p>Hosting the 2025 Africa Cup of Nations and co-hosting the 2030 World Cup with Spain and Portugal are not simply sporting events. They are catalysts for development.</p>
<p>From Tangier to Agadir, the upgrading of stadiums (Ibn Battouta, Moulay Abdellah, Adrar) goes beyond football. It\'s about creating interconnected hubs of life, culture, and leisure. These projects demand technical precision and rapid execution, where certified expertise becomes the key to success.</p>";}i:5;a:4:{s:4:"type";s:10:"subheading";s:7:"content";s:48:"2. Modernisation Intégrée : Au-delà du Béton";s:10:"content_en";s:0:"";s:13:"content_en_en";s:48:"2. Modernisation Intégrée : Au-delà du Béton";}i:6;a:3:{s:4:"type";s:9:"paragraph";s:7:"content";s:270:"<p>Le d&eacute;veloppement du Maroc repose sur une vision holistique. Avec un investissement colossal de plus de <strong data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="103">140 milliards de dirhams d\'ici 2025</strong>, le Royaume d&eacute;ploie des projets structurants :</p>";s:10:"content_en";s:170:"<p>Morocco\'s development is based on a holistic vision. With a colossal investment of over 140 billion dirhams by 2025, the Kingdom is deploying structuring projects:</p>";}i:7;a:4:{s:4:"type";s:4:"list";s:5:"items";a:3:{i:0;s:62:"Mobilité : Extension du réseau TGV et des lignes de Tramway.";i:1;s:81:"Souveraineté : Construction de stations de dessalement et de complexes solaires.";i:2;s:79:"Logistique : Expansion des ports et aéroports pour une connectivité mondiale.";}s:8:"items_en";a:3:{i:0;s:54:"Mobility: Extension of the TGV network and tram lines.";i:1;s:69:"Sovereignty: Construction of desalination plants and solar complexes.";i:2;s:67:"Logistics: Expansion of ports and airports for global connectivity.";}s:8:"listType";s:9:"unordered";}}s:9:"author_id";i:1;s:10:"created_at";s:27:"2026-03-25T15:12:51.000000Z";s:10:"updated_at";s:27:"2026-03-27T22:24:08.000000Z";s:10:"deleted_at";N;s:6:"author";a:2:{s:2:"id";i:1;s:4:"name";s:13:"Administrator";}s:9:"image_url";s:86:"http://localhost:8000/storage/posts/featured/5964f0bf-1b6c-4b70-a4f4-f33b67e739e7.webp";}}s:28:"'."\0".'*'."\0".'escapeWhenCastingToString";b:0;}