:"Nos valeurs";s:5:"title";s:18:"Ce que nous defons";s:4:"text";s:0:"";s:10:"empty_text";s:25:"Aucune valeur configuree.";}s:8:"projects";a:4:{s:8:"subtitle";s:11:"Nos projets";s:5:"title";s:31:"Découvrez nos derniers projets";s:4:"text";s:148:"<p>La construction commerciale englobe la conception, le d&eacute;veloppement et la construction de structures destin&eacute;es aux entreprises.</p>";s:5:"items";a:1:{i:0;a:4:{s:4:"slug";s:18:"unite-industrielle";s:5:"title";s:92:"Construction d’une unité industrielle de production de carrelage décoratif traditionnel.";s:6:"client";s:12:"PJLP SARL AU";s:15:"cover_image_url";s:77:"http://localhost:8000/storage/about/d84f913a-f25c-498f-bf89-2ff2cb4f28af.webp";}}}s:7:"contact";a:6:{s:8:"subtitle";s:14:"Contactez-nous";s:10:"form_title";s:28:"Prendre contact avec CITABIC";s:17:"contact_image_url";s:82:"http://localhost:8000/storage/contact/HKU8tDo9cxFPQaF6hlaThnVT2Jk8QQ7ZPSPzdxpD.png";s:9:"map_embed";s:380:"<iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d994.9369162131916!2d-5.811507772407547!3d35.771870542982874!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0xd0b810011ba8017%3A0xd6bdf01ad993f38f!2sCITABIC!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sma!4v1774108305722!5m2!1sen!2sma" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>";s:11:"submit_text";s:18:"Envoyer le message";s:19:"message_placeholder";s:13:"Votre message";}s:4:"blog";a:8:{s:8:"subtitle";s:19:"Actualités et blog";s:5:"title";s:27:"Découvrez nos perspectives";s:4:"text";s:245:"<p>La construction commerciale englobe la conception, le d&eacute;veloppement&nbsp; et l\'&eacute;dification de structures strat&eacute;giques d&eacute;di&eacute;es &agrave; la performance des entreprises.<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>";s:11:"browse_text";s:17:"Voir tout le blog";s:14:"read_more_text";s:13:"Lire la suite";s:13:"min_read_text";s:14:"min de lecture";s:10:"empty_text";s:36:"Aucun article publie pour le moment.";s:5:"