            'key' => 'about_text',
            'value' => '<p>Founded in 2021, <strong>CITABIC</strong> is a dynamic construction company that is reinventing the standards of building, renovation, and civil engineering through an innovative concept. Leveraging the experience and responsiveness of qualified professionals, the company is committed to supporting its clients in all their projects by offering superior quality turnkey solutions. Our credo is based on excellent service and seamless management, thus guaranteeing projects that precisely meet your needs and most demanding expectations.</p>',
